  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5582ee60568e052ebf04f175",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "其实，弓道水平高超到\\n能够射落飘落的树叶。",
      "source_fingerprint": "85db4f2c2f024126e560152f29bf3e8df701c7a443522cdc680d4a93345436c3",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "69",
        "9297"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:73b721cb572bfc8ffbf48dfb",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "其实，想了解近况的话\\n去看姐姐的Umasta会更快。",
      "source_fingerprint": "37b07e16f42df13b9ffa91074a08dd9b9b02cdf3ea8cdc21f94975c8feb12105",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "69",
        "9298"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1e9dd406b0fe7e31419bd19f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "其实，起名品味宛如武士一般。",
      "source_fingerprint": "99fd86f87fb44ac538c4adfbe3e31fbc354d4b304f5a3936fc3b583ac6981367",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "69",
        "9299"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e72ae3155830bc2246723425",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "二人世界",
      "source_fingerprint": "a1bd8e1aa4ceed7cb8a6ce1628a6166d189b5dc650f3e69041113003f75955e8",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "69",
        "93"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d2be022d1def5e39ddd4ca0e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "其实，每天都会尽可能把鞋子打理得干干净净。",
      "source_fingerprint": "389f972be4a9bc9ba21ae93b81488986ce4864d4837790570c98b272bb67cd65",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "69",
        "9300"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:483bc6ceb31f4050d0748a43",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "其实，在玩游戏时\\n一定会给主角起和自己相同的名字。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0e9a123478c60b232dd6c5d9a8f6ac38118b6a839b7698f881ed7b785245d631",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "69",
        "9301"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:026f539770b1666891c56316",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "其实，把自己拥有的所有教科书\\n都画满了翻页小漫画。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e723a34510d151badba9a3e1005159d6871fcc47b0d343c10c8d9a00ba3a8f1a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "69",
        "9302"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9a3d636072e5a42a610f80f9",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "其实，弱点是经常被检票闸机卡住。",
      "source_fingerprint": "91542c64c4fc865b2e515c35645b284f08e2d8f0c8fcfaa9cbe43c77430004c3",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "69",
        "9303"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3d2c995bf67e4301932d1e1c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "其实，备用手偶的眼神略显锐利。",
      "source_fingerprint": "51a59b1460528bf2988f3e5f6e246d1d30593a4513ce4277527f5905da373e76",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "69",
        "9304"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:88fa9c41ec8f0df13ab2a8f1",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "其实，绝对不会泄露他人的秘密。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1d38f409922dc48317201a2f05e744ff350beda509e3f9dd2f5b16dc21de7c4b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "69",
        "9305"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2be0f3bad912c3325da5e522",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "其实，经常跟不上\\n关于胡萝卜的话题讨论。",
      "source_fingerprint": "172b35a96e1bcd619ba23e04f6ebcf2ba493830a454f7b14aa856a1a86743366",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "69",
        "9306"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e5c17bd356a2643afb067ab1",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "其实，据说在赛车游戏中所展现的\\n车技相当惊人。",
      "source_fingerprint": "927b72505e7b7229646dc1f884094547859396abaa44064e67d917ce083f8990",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "69",
        "9307"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:050a0b41445e43bfa52b2612",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "其实，老家的甜点师\\n会定期寄来香草饼干。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5e16a27a04248d005340b524f0b499432ba1d80dd32a4f55035511deaf904a7f",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "69",
        "9308"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ed9313fbc1fbf2c3a65a5723",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "其实，是根据门童的素质来挑选酒店的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "df57bd8381310fbca22af90a0d5688befa9aabb8033715c304386132adc00eb5",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "69",
        "9309"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:93497bca6acd17704b236da6",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "其实，阅读报纸上的连载小说\\n是每天不为人知的小乐趣。",
      "source_fingerprint": "94999f6b26e389c6c2acc3fcf8bdb466c682abd21732c619da81fb11c04f1b49",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "69",
        "9310"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:62fc4273f7af6d8af29e91c2",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "其实，把学生时代在粉丝感谢祭上制作的\\n团队T恤当作家居服来穿。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3307a5c0ad0917c818151f8267a92eaef774bc54682ab37ebe8487330cec8d91",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "69",
        "9311"
      ]
    },
    {
